    "text": {
     "en": "Soil is made from broken rocks mixed with decayed plants and animals. It holds water and nutrients and supports plant growth. Different soils include sandy, clayey and loamy.\nRocks are used in building and for statues. Minerals such as iron, copper and gold are found in rocks and are mined.\nWe must protect soil from erosion by planting trees and using resources carefully."
    }
